/rpkv
*.test
/rpkv-data/

# per-package integration-test env overrides, loaded by rptest.Main (ADR-006)
.env

# agent worktrees, receipts, and local state; settings.json must stay
# committable since it wires the Stop hook
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json

# Agent definitions are vendored, for the same reason scripts/ is: they hold
# the delegation and quality-pass clauses that were previously re-typed into
# every prompt, and a retyping is a chance to drift. Pinned `model: sonnet`
# lives here too, so the rule stops depending on a session remembering it.
!/.claude/agents/

# The measurements stay local - quality-pass.json, check.log and coverage.log
# are reproducible by re-running the script over the sha they name. The
# acceptances do not: an .accepted file is a judgment someone made about a
# measured failure, it is the one thing here that cannot be recomputed, and a
# decision "on the record" that exists on one laptop is on no record at all.
!/.claude/receipts/
/.claude/receipts/*
!/.claude/receipts/*/
/.claude/receipts/*/*
!/.claude/receipts/*/*.accepted
